  "templates": [
    {
      "messageId": "SuH7He",
      "messageName": "Welcome — 01 Welcome + Free Shipping",
      "subject": "Welcome to Real Skin Care — free shipping inside 🌿",
      "templateId": "RPrD3C",
      "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<meta content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" name=\"viewport\"/>\n<meta content=\"light dark\" name=\"color-scheme\"/>\n<meta content=\"light dark\" name=\"supported-color-schemes\"/>\n<title>\n      Real Skin Care\n    </title>\n<style>@media only screen and (max-width: 480px) {\n    .px {\n        padding-left: 20px !important;\n        padding-right: 20px !important\n        }\n    .h1 {\n        font-size: 24px !important;\n        line-height: 30px !important\n        }\n    }</style></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#EDE5D8;\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;\">\n      Six ingredients, and a reason for each one. Your shipping is covered.\n    </div>\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background-color:#EDE5D8;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;\" width=\"600\">\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:8px 0 20px;font-family:Cabin,'Trebuchet MS','Segoe UI',Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#000000;\"> <a href=\"https://www.realskincare.com\" style=\"color:#000000;text-decoration:none;\">Real Skin Care</a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"px\" style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:12px;padding:36px 32px;\">\n<h1 class=\"h1\" style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-family:Cabin,'Trebuchet MS','Segoe UI',Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:28px;line-height:34px;font-weight:700;color:#000000;\">\n                  What you just signed up for\n                </h1>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#000000;\">\n                  Hi {{ first_name|default:\"there\" }} — here is the short version. Everything we make starts with cold-pressed virgin coconut oil and a list of ingredients short enough to read on one hand.\n                </p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#000000;\">\n                  Cold-pressed virgin coconut oil keeps its lauric acid, which is the part that actually does the work. Refined coconut oil is cheaper, neutral and more shelf-stable — the deodorising process strips the lauric acid out. We buy the expensive one, and that is most of why this costs more than the drugstore version.\n                </p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#000000;\">\n                  That is the whole pitch. No fillers to bulk out a tube, no synthetic fragrance, nothing added to make a label look better.\n                </p>\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"margin:0 0 24px;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:2px dashed #AEDEAC;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 34px;text-align:center;\">\n<div style=\"font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#000000;\">\n                              Free shipping on your first order\n                            </div>\n<div style=\"font-family:Cabin,'Trebuchet MS','Segoe UI',Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:4px;color:#000000;font-weight:700;margin-top:4px;\">\n                              SHIPFREE\n                            </div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"margin:0 0 28px;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#000000\" style=\"border-radius:6px;\">\n<a href=\"https://www.realskincare.com/collections/best-sellers\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:15px 32px;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;\">Shop best sellers</a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#000000;\">\n                  Use it at checkout. Orders over $45 ship free anyway.\n                </p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#000000;\">\n                  Take care,<br/><strong>Sean</strong><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Co-Founder, Real Skin Care</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin:20px 0 0;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid #EDEDED;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#000000;\">\n<strong>PS —</strong> Reply to this email if you want a recommendation for your skin — a real person answers, usually me.\n                </p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:22px 16px;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#000000;\">\n                Real Skin Care · 1623 Central Ave STE 201, Cheyenne, WY 82001, United States<br/>\n                Questions? Just reply, or email\n                <a href=\"mailto:support@realskincare.com\" style=\"color:#000000;\">support@realskincare.com</a>.<br/>\n<a href=\"https://x.com/realskincarecom\" style=\"color:#000000;\">X</a> ·<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/realskincare_com/\" style=\"color:#000000;\">Instagram</a> ·<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/real.skincare1\" style=\"color:#000000;\">Facebook</a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0 16px 22px;\"> <a href=\"{% unsubscribe_link %}\" style=\"font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#000000;text-decoration:underline;\">Don't want these? Unsubscribe here — no hard feelings.</a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>"
    },
    {
      "messageId": "Sq5RmQ",
      "messageName": "Welcome — 02 Brand Story",
      "subject": "We started this for a reason",
      "templateId": "TzuGfG",
      "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<meta content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" name=\"viewport\"/>\n<meta content=\"light dark\" name=\"color-scheme\"/>\n<meta content=\"light dark\" name=\"supported-color-schemes\"/>\n<title>\n      Real Skin Care\n    </title>\n<style>@media only screen and (max-width: 480px) {\n    .px {\n        padding-left: 20px !important;\n        padding-right: 20px !important\n        }\n    .h1 {\n        font-size: 24px !important;\n        line-height: 30px !important\n        }\n    }</style></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#EDE5D8;\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;\">\n      Julie started this over 20 years ago, for a reason that still decides every formula.\n    </div>\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background-color:#EDE5D8;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;\" width=\"600\">\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:8px 0 20px;font-family:Cabin,'Trebuchet MS','Segoe UI',Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#000000;\"> <a href=\"https://www.realskincare.com\" style=\"color:#000000;text-decoration:none;\">Real Skin Care</a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"px\" style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:12px;padding:36px 32px;\">\n<h1 class=\"h1\" style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-family:Cabin,'Trebuchet MS','Segoe UI',Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:28px;line-height:34px;font-weight:700;color:#000000;\">\n                  Why this exists\n                </h1>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#000000;\">\n                  Hi {{ first_name|default:\"there\" }} — I am Sean, co-founder. My sister-in-law Julie started Real Skin Care over 20 years ago, after looking for skincare that was both organic and genuinely simple and finding that it mostly did not exist.\n                </p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#000000;\">\n                  Twenty years later the test we apply to every formula is still hers:\n                  <em>if a cheaper substitute would do the same job, would we use it?</em> The answer is yes, honestly — if it would. The reason we do not is that the cheap substitutes do not.\n                </p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#000000;\">\n                  Baking soda is softer than enamel and neutralises oral acid. Hydrated silica is harder than enamel and simply abrades. Silica is cheaper. We use baking soda. That decision repeats itself across every product we make.\n                </p>\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"margin:0 0 28px;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#000000\" style=\"border-radius:6px;\">\n<a href=\"https://www.realskincare.com/collections/all\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:15px 32px;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;\">See what we make</a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#000000;\">\n                  Take care,<br/><strong>Sean</strong><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Co-Founder, Real Skin Care</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin:20px 0 0;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid #EDEDED;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#000000;\">\n<strong>PS —</strong> Handmade in the USA, in small enough batches that the texture shifts a little between runs. That is the coconut oil behaving like a real ingredient, not a defect.\n                </p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:22px 16px;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#000000;\">\n                Real Skin Care · 1623 Central Ave STE 201, Cheyenne, WY 82001, United States<br/>\n                Questions? Just reply, or email\n                <a href=\"mailto:support@realskincare.com\" style=\"color:#000000;\">support@realskincare.com</a>.<br/>\n<a href=\"https://x.com/realskincarecom\" style=\"color:#000000;\">X</a> ·<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/realskincare_com/\" style=\"color:#000000;\">Instagram</a> ·<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/real.skincare1\" style=\"color:#000000;\">Facebook</a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0 16px 22px;\"> <a href=\"{% unsubscribe_link %}\" style=\"font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#000000;text-decoration:underline;\">Don't want these? Unsubscribe here — no hard feelings.</a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>"
