one;width:180px;max-width:180px;height:auto;border:0;\" width=\"180\"/>\n</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:12px;padding:36px 32px;\">\n<h1 class=\"h1\" style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-family:Cabin,'Trebuchet MS','Segoe UI',Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:28px;line-height:34px;font-weight:700;color:#000000;\">Where most people start</h1>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#000000;\">Not sure what to try first? These three cover most people, and they are not interchangeable — each one suits a different problem.</p>\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"margin:0 0 14px;border-top:1px solid #EDEDED;padding-top:14px;\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td>\n<a href=\"https://www.realskincare.com/products/coconut-oil-deodorant\" style=\"font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:#000000;text-decoration:none;\">Coconut Oil Deodorant — $15</a>\n<div style=\"font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#000000;margin-top:2px;\">Aluminium-free. Expect a 1–2 week adjustment when you switch off antiperspirant — that is the point, not a flaw.</div>\n</td></tr></table>\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"margin:0 0 14px;border-top:1px solid #EDEDED;padding-top:14px;\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td>\n<a href=\"https://www.realskincare.com/products/coconut-oil-toothpaste\" style=\"font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:#000000;text-decoration:none;\">Coconut Oil Toothpaste — $13</a>\n<div style=\"font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#000000;margin-top:2px;\">Fluoride-free and SLS-free. It foams less than conventional paste, because the foam was the SLS.</div>\n</td></tr></table>\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"margin:0 0 14px;border-top:1px solid #EDEDED;padding-top:14px;\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td>\n<a href=\"https://www.realskincare.com/products/sensitive-skin-starter-set\" style=\"font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:#000000;text-decoration:none;\">Sensitive Skin Set — $46.80</a>\n<div style=\"font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#000000;margin-top:2px;\">The gentlest set we make, and cheaper than buying the pieces separately.</div>\n</td></tr></table>\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"margin:0 0 14px;border-top:1px solid #EDEDED;padding-top:14px;\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td>\n<a href=\"https://www.realskincare.com/products/clean-swap\" style=\"font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:#000000;text-decoration:none;\">The Clean Swap — $59</a>\n<div style=\"font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#000000;margin-top:2px;\">Replacing several things at once rather than trying one — save $10 against buying them singly.</div>\n</td></tr></table>\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"margin:0 0 28px;\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#000000\" style=\"border-radius:6px;\"><a href=\"https://www.realskincare.com/collections/best-sellers\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:15px 32px;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;\">Shop best sellers</a></td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#000000;\">Free shipping over $45.</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:22px 16px;font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#000000;\">\nReal Skin Care · 1623 Central Ave STE 201, Cheyenne, WY 82001, United States<br/>\nQuestions? Just reply, or email <a href=\"mailto:support@realskincare.com\" style=\"color:#000000;\">support@realskincare.com</a>.<br/>\n<a href=\"https://x.com/realskincarecom\" style=\"color:#000000;\">X</a> ·\n<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/realskincare_com/\" style=\"color:#000000;\">Instagram</a> ·\n<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/real.skincare1\" style=\"color:#000000;\">Facebook</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0 16px 22px;\">\n<a href=\"{% unsubscribe_link %}\" style=\"font-family:Outfit,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#000000;text-decoration:underline;\">Don't want these? Unsubscribe here — no hard feelings.</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>"
